    <!-- 초기화 확인.
         One dialog for seven rows. The title, the two paragraphs and the
         caution are written when it opens, from the same table the rows
         are drawn from - seven near-identical dialogs kept in the markup
         are seven places for the wording to drift apart, and the whole
         point of this screen is that the confirmation says exactly what
         the row promised.
         It can be left without answering three ways: 취소, the backdrop,
         and Escape. -->
    <div class="backdrop" id="dlg-reset">
      <div class="modal appear"></div>
    </div>
